      "path": "internal/hosted/graph/queries.go",
      "lineStart": 25,
      "lineEnd": 72,
      "title": "Adds language-specific graph query loading",
      "summary": "The graph package now maps 12 indexed languages to their grammars and embedded query files. Callers can list the supported languages, load a language’s query source, and compile it; unsupported languages and missing or invalid queries return errors."
